---
/** The bar above the header. One sentence, one link. */
---

<div class="shell pt-3">
  <a
    href="/#assistant"
    class="group flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border border-line bg-card px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] leading-5 transition-colors hover:border-line-strong"
  >
    <span class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2.5">
      <span class="size-[7px] shrink-0 bg-flag" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <span class="truncate">Wepilo now works inside Claude, ChatGPT and Cursor</span>
    </span>
    <span class="hidden shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-muted transition-colors group-hover:text-ink sm:flex">
      See how it works
      <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" class="size-3.5" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M3 8h10M9 4l4 4-4 4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" />
      </svg>
    </span>
  </a>
</div>
